      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nGLM-5.3 chat template no longer declares `enable_thinking`, but `Glm47MoeParser` still honored `enable_thinking=False` from `chat_template_kwargs`\r\n\r\nUsers who leave `enable_thinking=False` in kwargs with a 5.3 template may expect the usual no-op. However, the parser will still treat it as a request to disable reasoning separation which results in CoT leaks\r\n\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nServed `zai-org/GLM-5.3` and sent `extra_body={\"chat_template_kwargs\": {\"enable_thinking\": false}}`\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\nBefore: reasoning text leaks in `delta.content`.\r\nAfter: reasoning correctly arrives in `delta.reasoning`",
